Thus, one may assume $a=0$ for the remaining $ Z_{z, z'}^{a, 0}$ as well. Because $Z_{z, z}^{0, 0}=0$ and $Z_{y,x}^{0, 0} = -Z_{x,y}^{0, 0}+\partial h$, one can restrict to $Z_{x,y}^{0, 0}$.
This completes the proof.
\end{proof}

