    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.9\columnwidth]{cumulative_mass.png}
    \caption{Enclosed mass of the star cluster ({\em solid lines}) and of the gas ({\em dashed lines}) at \(4.5\,t_{\rm ff}\) for different resolutions, with the maximum refinement level $n$ given by the first digit of the model names. The half-mass radii of the star clusters at this time are indicated for each resolution by vertical dotted lines.}
