In that case, we must configure the algorithm to \textit{overestimate} the standard deviation of the asymptotic normal distribution of $\widetilde U_1$. This is equivalent to underestimating the disparity between the two group sizes, given by $ d_1 = \left|n_1 - n/2 \right|= \left|n_1/2 - n_2/2 \right|$, see Lemma~\ref{lem::vk}. 
