\subsubsection{Problem Analysis}\label{problem_and_closed_form}
We analyze the properties of Problem (P1) as follows.

{\noindent\textbf{Proposition 2:} \textit{In at least one optimal solution of Problem (P1), the radius of the on-device sensing subregion, i.e., $D^{\rm I,U}_{\rm max}$, is given by}
\begin{equation}\label{max_range}
\begin{aligned}
