In the current probe evaluation setup, the structure recognition task tends to perform better with the same representations as auto-tagging instead of beat-tracking (which is also a time-based task).
This suggests that representations focused on temporal details are not as useful as those that perform well on the classification of semantic categories for this task.
% Lastly, difficulty estimation achieves SOTA in MSE following the same trend as auto-tagging.
Lastly, the \textit{base} model achieved the highest MSE value in difficulty estimation, following the same trend as auto-tagging.
