\includegraphics[width=0.35\textwidth]{Fig2aa.pdf}
\includegraphics[width=0.45\textwidth]{Fig2b.pdf}
\caption{Phases of the vertical ladder. Upper: illustration of different phases with arrows representing the first-order spin $S^{z}$, filled (empty) circles representing up (down) spins or filled (empty) fermions. Lower: phase diagram of the vertical ladder with $\tilde{K}=0.8$, $J_{x}=J_{y}=1$ obtained from the fermionic ground-state energy in \eqref{spinladderH}.}
