\includegraphics[width=0.7\textwidth]{fig9.png}
\caption{Observer defining multiple reference frames in physical or cognitive
space.}
\label{fig:frames}
\end{figure}

Hence, observation acts not just as a mechanism but as a conceptual foundation for partitioning, measuring, and categorizing phenomena.


