\caption{Sample images taken from the Nemo cluster detection pipeline. The left panel shows the true DMB cluster signal as a change in temperature $\delta T$ in $\mu \rm{K}$ with a 90 GHz beam. The middle panel shows the cluster signal combined with a simulated primary CMB signal. The rightmost panel shows the impact of noise on the cluster signal, and the necessity for matched filters to identify the underlying cluster. \label{fig:iii}}
