In June 2022, the government \href{https://kormany.hu/hirek/nyertes-palyazatnak-koszonhetoen-epul-uj-magyar-szuperszamitogep-csillebercen-a-jelenlegi-kapacitas-negyvenszereset-tudja-majd-levente}{\textcolor{blue}{announced}} a new computer named ``Levente'' to be built with the computing capacity of 20 petaflops, four times greater than Komodor's. The EU funding for the project amounts to 7 billion HUF (\textasciitilde EUR 17,600,000). No information could be found on how much the local government contributes. \\
