\item Hungarian agrarian model farms: No official announcement or confirmation was made about the accreditation of any Hungarian model farms as European testing environment. TEF's relevant branch is agrifoodTEF, also launched in mid-2023. Even Hungary's flagship digital farm (the Mezőhegyes National Stud Farm's smart agriculture center) is not part of the project as of agrifoodTEF's \href{https://www.agrifoodtef.eu/catalogue-of-services?search_api_fulltext=}{\textcolor{blue}{official catalogue}}.
