\item Budapest's Medianets Lab (BME) is co-developing an AI-based traffic light control system, \href{https://www.itsinternational.com/its4/its5/its8/news/new-ai-traffic-project-developed-hungary-turkey-and-japan}{\textcolor{blue}{TRALICO}}, with partners in Turkey and Japan. This system uses deep learning to forecast congestion and optimize signals and is set to be tested on the streets of Istanbul.
