\begin{itemize}
\item Short-range V2X transmitters were \href{https://internet.kozut.hu/2019/04/23/a-magyar-kozut-a-szomszedos-orszagok-kozutkezeloivel-kozosen-keszul-az-onvezeto-autozasra}{\textcolor{blue}{installed}} on the M0 ring road around Budapest as early as 2019, laying groundwork for connected and automated driving corridors.
