The government also outlined (back in 2019) the \href{https://neum.hu/das/}{\textcolor{blue}{Digitális Agrár Stratégia}} (Digital Agriculture Strategy) for preparing Hungary's agri-sector for advanced technologies. Apart from that, The National Agriculture Chamber (NAK) created a TechLab incubator in 2019 to accelerate agritech startups. By 2021, over 50 agrár-tech startups had been nurtured. \\
